&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Position Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Solutions Sales Executive is a strong solution specialist with deep working knowledge of Diligent’s Risk &amp;amp; Audit products. This role supports revenue growth by understanding customer needs, positioning the right solutions, and helping customers address specific and sometimes complex Risk &amp;amp; Audit challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is an individual contributor role focused on engaging with customers, supporting opportunities, and partnering closely with Account Executives throughout the customer journey. As a trusted solution partner, the Solutions Sales Executive II provides product and domain&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;during co-selling and solution discussions, helping to influence customer decisions. The role also includes contributing to shared learning by exchanging knowledge and best practices with peers across the sales organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position suits a commercially aware, collaborative professional who enjoys working in a solution-led sales environment, influencing outcomes through&amp;nbsp;expertise, and consistently delivering results while living&amp;nbsp;Diligent’s&amp;nbsp;values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
